<title>UK: TT Group Plc H1 pretax profits rise 22 pct.</title>
<headline>TT Group Plc H1 pretax profits rise 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		9.6		    vs 8.1</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.80		   vs 2.44</p>
<p> Pretax		     22.80		  vs 18.70</p>
<p> Turnover		   266.65		 vs 231.41</p>
<p> Operating profit	 23.74		  vs 19.29</p>
<p> Interest		   0.93		   vs 0.59</p>
<p> Tax			  7.05		   vs 5.44</p>
<p> Net taxed		  15.76		  vs 13.26</p>
<p> Retained profit	  10.75		  vs 8.80</p>
<p> Pay date		   Oct 24</p>
<p>Div registration date  Oct 8</p>
<p>NOTE- Engineering and metals firm TT Group Plc said order books were &quot;at a level which provide a sound basis for the remainder of the year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
